  "persona": "",
  "subject": "a red minibus driver whose little plastic Guan Yu figure falls off the dashboard on a corner, and he pulls over and refuses to move until the passengers find it under the seats",
  "caption": "Cantonese Eurobeat, 1990s Italo-Japanese racing style. Bright saw-wave lead riffing in sixteenths, pumping octave synth bass, gated four-on-the-floor drum machine, orchestra-hit stabs on every chorus downbeat, short filtered synth arpeggio breaks. Glossy Avex-style mix, wide stereo, hard compression. Male tenor, high urgent clearly sung melody. 156 BPM, E minor. Mock-heroic, frantic and comic. No trap drums, no autotune, no rap, no dubstep drops, no slow ballad sections.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n紅van衝落彌敦道\n轉彎一下好大力\n車頭神台嗰尊關公\n啪一聲跌咗落地\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n司機即刻打燈埋站\n手掣一拉唔再郁\n佢話搵唔返就唔開\n\n[Chorus]\n關公跌咗 關公跌咗\n全車十六個伏低搵\n冇關老爺我唔夠膽\n今日呢架車唔開\n\n[Verse]\n西裝阿叔趴喺地下\n學生妹開晒電筒\n阿婆話佢見過紅色\n原來係人哋嘅波鞋\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n後面架巴士狂㩒咹\n司機照飲佢杯檸茶\n佢話神就係要尊重\n\n[Chorus]\n關公跌咗 關公跌咗\n全車十六個伏低搵\n個個遲到冇人敢鬧\n關老爺未返車唔開\n\n[Verse]\n最尾一個細路仔\n喺坐位底拎佢出嚟\n把刀斷咗少少\n鬍鬚仲係好威\n\n[Bridge]\n司機用膠紙黐返佢\n雙手合十拜兩拜\n\n[Chorus]\n關公返咗 關公返咗\n全車拍手好似奪冠\n司機一腳油衝出去\n我哋個心跳得仲快\n\n[Outro]\n下次轉彎慢少少\n關老爺都會頭暈",
